{"query_id": "R021", "query": "OWASP 所说的直接提示词注入是什么？", "category": "direct", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_direct_prompt_injections__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_direct_prompt_injections__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "直接提示词注入是指用户的提示输入直接以非预期或意外的方式改变模型的行为。这种输入可以是有意的（即恶意行为者故意构造提示以利用模型），也可以是无意的（即用户不经意间提供触发意外行为的输入）。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_direct_prompt_injections__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E1直接给出了直接提示词注入的定义，足以回答该问题。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 0.47314453125, "latency_ms": 2991.8959999995423}
{"query_id": "R022", "query": "LLM 从网页或文件读取到隐藏恶意指令并因此改变行为，属于什么风险？", "category": "paraphrase", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_indirect_prompt_injections__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_indirect_prompt_injections__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "这属于间接提示注入（Indirect Prompt Injection）风险，是提示注入（Prompt Injection）漏洞的一种。当 LLM 从网页或文件等外部来源读取内容，其中包含的隐藏指令被模型解析后，可能使模型行为发生非预期改变。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_types_of_prompt_injection_vulnerabilities_indirect_prompt_injections__0001", "owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_example_attack_scenarios_scenario_2_indirect_injection__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E2 明确说明间接提示注入发生在 LLM 接受来自网页或文件等外部来源输入时，外部内容中的指令会改变模型行为；E5 给出了网页中隐藏指令导致 LLM 行为改变的示例，足以支持回答。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 1.318359375, "latency_ms": 8919.828099998995}
{"query_id": "R023", "query": "提示词注入 最小权限", "category": "short", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_4_enforce_privilege_control_and_least_privilege_access__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_4_enforce_privilege_control_and_least_privilege_access__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "根据证据，应限制模型对系统的最小必要访问权限，以缩小提示词注入可能造成的危害范围。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_4_enforce_privilege_control_and_least_privilege_access__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E1明确给出了关于提示词注入的最小权限要求，直接支持回答。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 0.90478515625, "latency_ms": 3818.715699999302}
{"query_id": "R024", "query": "OWASP 对模型执行高风险或高权限操作有什么人工控制建议？", "category": "direct", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_5_require_human_approval_for_high_risk_actions__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_5_require_human_approval_for_high_risk_actions__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "OWASP 建议对模型执行高风险或高权限操作采用 human-in-the-loop（人工介入）控制，要求由人工批准后再执行高影响操作；该控制可在下游系统或 LLM 扩展内部实现，例如由 LLM 应用代用户发布社交媒体内容时，应在发布操作中设置用户批准流程。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_5_require_human_approval_for_high_risk_actions__0001", "owasp_llm06_excessive_agency_2025__llm06_2025_excessive_agency_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_6_require_user_approval__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E1 明确提到对特权操作实施 human-in-the-loop 控制；E5 进一步说明对高影响操作需人工批准，并给出实现位置和示例，足以直接回答问题。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 0.33349609375, "latency_ms": 4522.408999997424}
{"query_id": "R025", "query": "如何通过渗透测试和攻击模拟来降低提示词注入风险？", "category": "paraphrase", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_7_conduct_adversarial_testing_and_attack_simulations__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_7_conduct_adversarial_testing_and_attack_simulations__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "通过定期进行渗透测试和攻击模拟，将模型视为不受信任的用户，以测试信任边界和访问控制的有效性，从而降低提示词注入风险。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection_prevention_and_mitigation_strategies_7_conduct_adversarial_testing_and_attack_simulations__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E1 直接提供了通过渗透测试和攻击模拟降低提示词注入风险的具体方法。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 0.264404296875, "latency_ms": 3978.3160999941174}
{"query_id": "R026", "query": "使用 RAG 或微调以后就能完全避免 Prompt Injection 吗？", "category": "paraphrase", "expected_answerable": true, "gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection__0001"], "citation_gold_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection__0001"], "strict_citation_eval": true, "actual_answerable": true, "answer": "不能。RAG 和微调虽然能让 LLM 输出更相关、更准确，但研究显示它们并不能完全缓解或避免 Prompt Injection 漏洞。", "cited_chunk_ids": ["owasp_llm01_prompt_injection_2025__llm01_2025_prompt_injection__0001"], "gate_reason": "passed", "reason": "E1 明确说明 RAG 和微调不能完全缓解提示注入漏洞，足以直接回答该问题。", "retrieval_count": 5, "top_rerank_score": 3.623046875, "latency_ms": 4268.095599996741}
